      </dl>
      </li>
      <li>
      Update the cluster-wide proxy configuration with the newly created config map:
      <CodeBlock code={"$ oc patch proxy/cluster \\\n     --type=merge \\\n     --patch='{\"spec\":{\"trustedCA\":{\"name\":\"custom-ca\"}}}'"} lang="terminal" />
      <Alert variant="note" class="my-4">
        <AlertTitle>Note</AlertTitle>
